      "message": "What is the motivation for this change?\n\nI don\u0027t think we want to do this, it adds a lot of complexity and potential for bugs. For example, if you replace one binary with another, and the new one requires more/different shared libraries, those dependencies won\u0027t be encoded in the build system anymore.\n\nAlso, the build should not download anything from the network. If I understand this correctly you\u0027re not actually downloading stuff, but merely copying it out of another folder, but the naming is concerning.",
